      "detail": "Persistent single/multifile branches require matched retirement.storageReleased before the unchanged payload fsync/state/intent/inventory completion path. Removal identity includes registered weak ownership and operation userdata, then expiry/error checks and fresh response. Error/loss joins poisoned owner rather than certifying. Stats-only failure retains uncertainty rather than synthetic zero or an exact seal."
    },
    {
      "id": "FP3",
      "status": "PASS",
      "detail": "create rejects unqualified runtime before Impl construction/LT calls. CMake default explicitly emits BOUND0; opt-in requires reviewed source/runtime manifest and actual imported artifact. Runtime checks original exports, current mapped identity and descriptor hash with nofollow/nonblock/stable metadata. Bridge falls back ONLY for DependencyUnqualified; invalid/memory/other factory errors are not silently downgraded."
    },
